    <widget class="QLabel" name="lblRedeemIntro">
     <property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property>
     <property name="text"><string>Redeeming destroys (burns) YDollar and releases a vault's collateral back to you. This is the one operation that talks to anything other than your own node: the owner-signed transaction is sent to the federation operators for co-signatures, then verified again by your node before it is broadcast. Your node signs; the operators never see a private key.</string></property>
    </widget>
   </item>
